                "id": "new-1785254781821",
                "title_zh": "维特根斯坦私人笔记1914-1916",
                "title_en": "Wittgenstein Private Notebooks 1914-1916",
                "date": "2026-07-27",
                "tags_zh": [
                    "哲学",
                    "日记"
                ],
                "tags_en": [
                    "philosophy",
                    "diary"
                ],
                "content_zh": "我觉得还是有所收获的。至少让我知道W也是跟我相同：为卑劣感到不满，为世界不遵守一个应然秩序恼怒，对自己也感到不满。",
                "content_en": "I think I still gained something. At least let me know that W is the same as me: dissatisfied with baseness, angry that the world does not follow a proper order, and dissatisfied with himself.",
                "images": [],
                "videos": [],
                "links": []
            }
